<title>ARGENTINA: Forecast - Average Argentine Indicators Survey.</title>
<headline>Forecast - Average Argentine Indicators Survey.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are consensus forecasts from a Reuters survey of Argentine economic indicators conducted with the offices of 10 brokerage and research firms in Buenos Aires.</p>
<p>Date   Indicator   Period  Average    Median     Previous</p>
<p>					  Forecasts	  Official data</p>
<p>03/01  CPI	   Dec     +0.1 pct   +0.1 pct   -0.2 pct</p>
<p>02/01* Tax revenue Dec     $3.77 bln  $3.77 bln  $3.72 bln</p>
<p>30/12  Indus prod  Nov     +12.4 pct  +13.0 pct  +12.5 pct</p>
<p>06/01  Trade bal   Nov     $-237 million  $-225 million  $-42 million</p>
<p>N/A    GDP	   Q4	+7.3 pct   +7.5 pct   +6.6 pct</p>
<p>* indicates approximate date</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
